# Jak 1's title as jak1_title_a.sim, with the right hand turned down off the panel (no dot on the menu).
# before and after A: the title menu should be up (t-menu), and A should bring the save slots (t-after-a) (sim b54
# ptr1slots: after A the menu was gone and the title said PRESS START again).
2300 hand_pitch -70
2400 menu 1
2406 menu 0
2500 shot t-menu
2650 shot t-menu2
2700 a 1
2706 a 0
2730 shot t-after-a
2800 shot t-after-a2
2950 shot t-after-a3
3000 quit 0
